## Contact plan for the xlsa benchmark.
##
## Two nodes (engine ids 2 and 3) on the same host, exchanging bundles
## over LTP carried by the generic xlsa link service (xlso/xlsi) with the
## shared-memory backend.
##
## IMPORTANT: the contact rate set here MUST match XLSA_RATE_BPS exported
## in dotest.  See ltp/xlsa/doc/DESIGN.md §3.5 for why all three rates
## (BP Throttle nominalRate, LTP localXmitRate, XLSA_RATE_BPS) must agree
## for a steady-state baseline.
##
## 2 000 000 000 bytes/sec = 2 GB/s (matches bench-ltp's contact rate so
## results can be compared directly).

m horizon  +0
a range    +0 +600        2 3   1
a contact  +0 +420        2 3   2000000000
a contact  +0 +600        3 2   2000000000
